# 统一行尾符策略
# 仓库内容以 LF 存储，避免本地开发与 GitHub 网页上传之间的行尾符差异
# 反复制造整文件伪冲突（diff 显示上千行，实际内容一致）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary

# 脚本与源码强制 LF
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
